l:space="preserve">午餐地点</t></is></c><c r="C17" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">和朋友一起聚餐</t></is></c><c r="D17" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">和朋友一起吃</t></is></c><c r="E17" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">热闹的午餐场景，聊天和分享让这一餐更轻松。</t></is></c><c r="F17" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">data/layouts-act2.json panels.tooltipTitle/tooltipText；Act2 地点独立 tooltip</t></is></c></row><row r="18" ht="50" customHeight="1"><c r="A18" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">第二幕 Act2</t></is></c><c r="B18" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">午餐地点</t></is></c><c r="C18" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">食堂和同事吃</t></is></c><c r="D18" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">办公桌吃饭</t></is></c><c r="E18" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">工作消息和午餐同时出现，节奏更紧也更容易被打断。</t></is></c><c r="F18" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">data/layouts-act2.json panels.tooltipTitle/tooltipText；Act2 地点独立 tooltip</t></is></c></row><row r="19" ht="50" customHeight="1"><c r="A19" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">第二幕 Act2</t></is></c><c r="B19" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">午餐地点</t></is></c><c r="C19" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">公园长椅上</t></is></c><c r="D19" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">公园长椅</t></is></c><c r="E19" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">在户外慢慢吃饭，周围的小动物会带来一点意外互动。</t></is></c><c r="F19" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">data/layouts-act2.json panels.tooltipTitle/tooltipText；Act2 地点独立 tooltip</t></is></c></row><row r="20" ht="50" customHeight="1"><c r="A20" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">第二幕 Act2</t></is></c><c r="B20" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">午餐地点</t></is></c><c r="C20" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">食堂一人食</t></is></c><c r="D20" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">一个人吃饭</t></is></c><c r="E20" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">安静地独自用餐，注意力会更多落在自己和餐盘上。</t></is></c><c r="F20" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">data/layouts-act2.json panels.tooltipTitle/tooltipText；Act2 地点独立 tooltip</t></is></c></row><row r="21" ht="50" customHeight="1"><c r="A21" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">第三幕 Act3</t></is></c><c r="B21" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">食物</t></is></c><c r="C21" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">蔬菜</t></is></c><c r="D21" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">蔬菜</t></is></c><c r="E21" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">叶片在锅里慢慢舒展开，边缘变得柔软，吸进一点汤汁后颜色更深。夹起来时还带着水汽，是火锅里最容易被忽略、但总会被放进锅里的那一类食物。</t></is></c><c r="F21" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">game.js ACT3_HOVER_INFO.act3_s01_food_vegetable</t></is></c></row><row r="22" ht="34" customHeight="1"><c r="A22" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">第三幕 Act3</t></is></c><c r="B22" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">食物</t></is></c><c r="C22" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">午餐肉</t></is></c><c r="D22" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">午餐肉</t></is></c><c r="E22" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">方方正正的粉红色薄片，边缘被汤底煮得微微卷起。入口很软，带着均匀的咸香味，像火锅里最稳定、最不会出错的配角。</t></is></c><c r="F22" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">game.js ACT3_HOVER_INFO.act3_s01_food_luncheonMeat</t></is></c></row><row r="23" ht="34" customHeight="1"><c r="A23" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">第三幕 Act3</t></is></c><c r="B23" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">食物</t></is></c><c r="C23" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">小腊肠</t></is></c><c r="D23" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">小腊肠</t></is></c><c r="E23" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">小小一截，煮过之后表面变得油亮，甜咸味会慢慢散进汤里。咬开时外皮有轻微弹性，里面的肉馅更紧实。</t></is></c><c r="F23" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">game.js ACT3_HOVER_INFO.act3_s01_food_sausage</t></is></c></row><row r="24" ht="34" customHeight="1"><c r="A24" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">第三幕 Act3</t></is></c><c r="B24" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">食物</t></is></c><c r="C24" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">油条</t></is></c><c r="D24" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">油条</t></is></c><c r="E24" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">原本蓬松酥脆的油条进入锅里后，会迅速吸满汤汁，外层变软，里面还保留一点空心的结构。夹起来时比刚放进去沉了很多。</t></is></c><c r="F24" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">game.js ACT3_HOVER_INFO.act3_s01_food_youtiao</t></is></c></row><row r="25" ht="34" customHeight="1"><c r="A25" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">第三幕 Act3</t></is></c><c r="B25" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">食物</t></is></c><c r="C25" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">毛肚</t></is></c><c r="D25" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">毛肚</t></is></c><c r="E25" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">薄薄的一片，表面有细密的纹理。在锅里轻轻涮过后会卷曲起来，入口爽脆，咀嚼时有很明显的弹性和颗粒感。</t></is></c><c r="F25" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">game.js ACT3_HOVER_INFO.act3_s01_food_maodu</t></is></c></row><row r="26" ht="34" customHeight="1"><c r="A26" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">第三幕 Act3</t></is></c><c r="B26" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">食物</t></is></c><c r="C26" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">带肉脆骨</t></is></c><c r="D26" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">带肉脆骨</t></is></c><c r="E26" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">肉和脆骨连在一起，煮熟后边缘微微收紧。咬下去先是肉的柔韧感，然后是脆骨清脆的阻力，越嚼越有存在感。</t></is></c><c r="F26" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">game.js ACT3_HOVER_INFO.act3_s01_food_daiRouCuiGu</t></is></c></row><row r="27" ht="34" customHeight="1"><c r="A27" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">第三幕 Act3</t></is></c><c r="B27" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">食物</t></is></c><c r="C27" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">肥牛卷</t></is></c><c r="D27" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">肥牛卷</t></is></c><c r="E27" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">薄片卷成一圈，放进锅里很快展开并变色。脂肪纹理在汤里散开，入口柔软，带着火锅汤底的香气。</t></is></c><c r="F27" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">game.js ACT3_HOVER_INFO.act3_s01_food_beefSlices</t></is></c></row><row r="28" ht="34" customHeight="1"><c r="A28" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">第三幕 Act3</t></is></c><c r="B28" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">锅底</t></is></c><c r="C28" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">清汤锅</t></is></c><c r="D28" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">清汤锅</t></is></c><c r="E28" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">汤色清亮，味道温和，更容易保留食材本身的口感和香气。</t></is></c><c r="F28" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">game.js ACT3_HOVER_INFO.act3_s01_target_clearPot</t></is></c></row><row r="29" ht="34" customHeight="1"><c r="A29" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">第三幕 Act3</t></is></c><c r="B29" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">锅底</t></is></c><c r="C29" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">辣锅</t></is></c><c r="D29" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">辣锅</t></is></c><c r="E29" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">红油翻滚，香料味浓，食材会裹上麻辣汤底的味道。</t></is></c><c r="F29" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">game.js ACT3_HOVER_INFO.act3_s01_target_spicyPot</t></is></c></row><row r="30" ht="34" customHeight="1"><c r="A30" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">第三幕 Act3</t></is></c><c r="B30" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">饮品</t></is></c><c r="C30" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">威士忌</t></is></c><c r="D30" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">威士忌</t></is></c><c r="E30" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">酒精度数较高的琥珀色烈酒，入口辛辣，带有木质、烟熏或焦糖余味。</t></is></c><c r="F30" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">game.js ACT3_HOVER_INFO.act3_s02_drink_highAlcohol</t></is></c></row><row r="31" ht="34" customHeight="1"><c r="A31" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">第三幕 Act3</t></is></c><c r="B31" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">饮品</t></is></c><c r="C31" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">啤酒</t></is></c><c r="D31" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">啤酒</t></is></c><c r="E31" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">酒精度数较低，冰镇后杯壁会挂着水汽，泡沫细密，带有麦芽香、气泡感和轻微苦味。</t></is></c><c r="F31" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">game.js ACT3_HOVER_INFO.act3_s02_drink_lowAlcohol</t></is></c></row><row r="32" ht="34" customHeight="1"><c r="A32" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">第三幕 Act3</t></is></c><c r="B32" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">饮品</t></is></c><c r="C32" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">蜜瓜苏打</t></is></c><c r="D32" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">蜜瓜苏打</t></is></c><c r="E32" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">不含酒精的软饮料，入口冰凉、有气泡感，会带出一种很人工、但很快乐的蜜瓜香味。</t></is></c><c r="F32" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">game.js ACT3_HOVER_INFO.act3_s02_drink_softDrink</t></is></c></row><row r="33" ht="34" customHeight="1"><c r="A33" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">第三幕 Act3</t></is></c><c r="B33" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">饮品</t></is></c><c r="C33" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">柠檬水</t></is></c><c r="D33" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">柠檬水</t></is></c><c r="E33" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">不含酒精的软饮料，清透微酸，带有柠檬香气，口感清爽，火锅吃到一半时，它像是给嘴巴按了一下刷新键。</t></is></c><c r="F33" t="inlineStr" s="1"><is><t xml:space="preserve">game.js ACT3_HOVER_INFO.act3_s02_drink_lemonWater</t></is></c></row></sheetData><pageMargins left="0.7" right="0.7" top="0.75" bottom="0.75" header="0.3" footer="0.3"/></worksheet>